<title>USA: TABLE - Sundstrand Corp Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sundstrand Corp Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			   1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.71		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			 43,000		   34,000</p>
<p> Revs		     440,000		  371,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,100		   61,400</p>
<p>	   SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.29		    $0.98</p>
<p> Net			 78,000		   60,000</p>
<p> Revs		     829,000		  739,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,100		   61,400</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 and six-month 1997 results include restructuring pretax charge of $1.0 million, or $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 results include restructuring curtailment pretax gain of $8.0 million, or $0.08 a share, and restructuring expenses of $5 million pretax, or $0.05 a share.</p>
<p>Excluding the above charges, Q2 operating income was $0.72 a share vs $0.53.</p>
<p>Six-month 1996 results include restructuring expenses of $10 million pretax, or $0.10 a share. Excluding items for both periods, six-month 1997 operating earnings were $1.30 a share vs $0.98.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
